        <span class="story-chip"><span class="story-num">01</span> Receiving</span>
        <h2>No manual counts. No assumptions.</h2>
        <p>The journey starts at the loading dock. Units arrive either pre-tagged at manufacturing, or they are tagged here, a process called commissioning. Each tag is printed, applied, and linked directly to the exact unit being received.</p>
        <ul class="feature-bullets">
          <li>A portable RFID scanner captures every EPC in the shipment at once</li>
          <li>Our system cross-checks what was expected against what actually arrived, at the unit quantity level</li>
          <li>Just verification from the very start</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
